  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mastery over your form is great enough to allow you to transform into a true spider.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Cha 13, werespider-kin</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can take the form of a spider(use the scarlet spider statistics presented in the Pathfinder Roleplaying Game Ultimate Magic) whose appearance is static and cannot be changed each time you assume this form. You gain a +10 racial bonus on Disguise checks to appear as a spider. Changing from werespider-kin to spider shape is a standard action. This ability otherwise functions as vermin shape II<sup>UM</sup>, and your ability scores change accordingly.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you also have the Mystic Spinnerets feat, you gain its benefits while under the effects of this feat. You are always treated as having a free hand for the purposes of using Lashing Spinnerets while in this form.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/skinwalker-heritages#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
